This product contains Android/KakaoTalk interoperability code informed by:

Iris (https://github.com/dolidolih/Iris)
   Used as a behavioral and schema reference for KakaoTalk DB observation,
   notification reply, and image share flows. Iris contains MIT-licensed code
   and a specifically identified GPL-3.0 NotificationPoller file. noa does not
   include that NotificationPoller implementation or other GPL source.

The noa source layout, internal identifiers, control flow, Actix API, asset
pipeline, audit archive, presence reconciliation, and dashboard are original
implementations. Platform ABI names and KakaoTalk protocol identifiers retain
their externally required spelling.

This product embeds LSPlant 6.4 from LSPosed
(https://github.com/LSPosed/LSPlant), licensed under LGPL-3.0. The embedded
library is built from commit 7217ac6f41e2bda549e4acb54e632abb03e5ccaf with
the source modification in
patches/lsplant-6.4-optional-fixup-static-trampolines.patch. Noa loads the
library dynamically in the target process. The license texts are provided in
licenses/LSPLANT-LGPL-3.0 and licenses/GPL-3.0.

This product embeds Frida Core and Frida Gum from Frida
(https://github.com/frida/frida). Its license notice is provided in
licenses/FRIDA.

